<title>USA: NETCOM to bundle Cisco equipment.</title>
<headline>NETCOM to bundle Cisco equipment.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NETCOM On-Line Communication Services Inc said Thursday it would use a variety of Cisco Systems Inc network components to deliver premium network services to small and medium-sized business customers.</p>
<p>In exchange, NETCOM said, it will receive marketing support from Cisco and be able to offer customers an early peek at new Cisco product offerings.</p>
</text>
